{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewDepreciationEntry\">New Depreciation Entry</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Depreciation DepreciationEntries DepreciationEntry From FromDate Line Lines NewDepreciationEntry On\">The New Depreciation Entry Lines screen creates depreciation entries from the worksheet.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create Depreciation Difference Journal JournalEntries On View\">Review and create journal entries for calculated depreciation differences.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Date Depreciation General_ledger Is On\">The date when the depreciation will be recorded in the general ledger. This is typically the last day of the accounting period.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Date Depreciation Is On\">This date determines which accounting period the depreciation expense affects. Use month-end or year-end dates for consistent depreciation recording.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FixedAsset\">Fixed Asset</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FixedAsset\">Fixed Asset</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Depreciation DepreciationRate Fixed_asset FixedAsset Is Method On Rate\">The specific fixed asset for which depreciation is being calculated and recorded. Each asset depreciates based on its individual depreciation rate and method.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Active Assets Calculation Date Depreciation Disposed Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets From FromDate Is On\">The system calculates depreciation for all active fixed assets that have a depreciable value. Disposed assets are excluded from calculations after their disposal date.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Depreciation Is On Sent To ToDate\">The calculated depreciation expense amount for this asset during the specified period. This represents the reduction in asset value due to usage and time.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AccumulatedDepreciation Amount And BookValue Calculation Credit Debit Depreciation DepreciationRate Edit Is On Rate\">This amount will be recorded as depreciation expense (debit) and accumulated depreciation (credit). The calculation is based on the asset's book value, depreciation rate, and time period.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "new-depreciation-entry-lines"
}
